537
00:58:28.469 --> 00:58:32.458
Something happened, and I... I changed it.

538
00:58:37.123 --> 00:58:38.943
Do you want to talk about it?

539
00:58:41.394 --> 00:58:45.020
Do you ever think back
at a different time in your life...

540
00:58:46.966 --> 00:58:51.422
...and a different person you used to be...

541
