549
01:00:56.038 --> 01:01:00.454
Do you know what sort of crime
reports the public has access to?

550
01:01:00.534 --> 01:01:02.345
On-campus crime?

551
01:01:07.674 --> 01:01:11.465
They release these every year...
Clery statistics.

552
01:01:11.545 --> 01:01:13.797
Clery statistics.

553
01:01:32.699 --> 01:01:33.983
All set?

554
01:01:35.001 --> 01:01:38.488
